    body: '| Class | In game |\n| --- | --- |\n| [[class-warrior|Warrior]] | Masters of melee combat with shields |\n| [[class-archer|Archer]] | Ranged fighters with pet mastery |\n| [[class-mage|Mage]] | Wielders of arcane magic |\n| [[class-rogue|Rogue]] | A dual-wielding assassin who strikes fast with twin daggers |\n| [[class-druid|Druid]] | A wild guardian who channels their strength into a mighty pet companion |\n\n## How skill trees work\n\nEvery class tree has three branches with six skills each. Within a branch, tier 2 unlocks after 5 points in that branch and tier 3 after 10. Class points come from levels, up to 100 points.\n\nYour class is only part of the build. Your [[build-types|stance]] determines whether you lean into Attack, Pet Damage, Retaliation or Harmony.',
